:: Act3_7Eleven_Flank {"position":"750,2050","size":"100,100"}
<<nobr>>
<<set $currentLocation to "seven_eleven_back">>
<<set _arrivedLate to (visited("Act2_5_MarcusCabin"))>>
<</nobr>>

<h2>7-ELEVEN — BACK STORAGE ROOM FLANK</h2>

You silently slide past the overflowing alley dumpster and force open the squeaking rear service door with your blade.
<br><br>
Inside the rear storage room, stacks of cardboard boxes provide complete cover. Two scavengers are leaning around the beverage cooler door, spraying gunfire into the front floor.
<br><br>
<<chat "Reyes (Whispering)" "image/avatars/reyes.gif" "right" "Perfect ambush angle. On my mark, take out the guy on the left!">>

<br><br>
With a coordinated burst of silenced fire, you drop both scavengers before they even realize you're behind them!
<br><br>
The heavy walk-in cooler door clicks open. Commander Miller steps out, wiping sweat from his brow, holding a jerrycan of fuel and a shotgun!

<br><br>
<<chat "Commander Miller" "image/avatars/quartermaster_sgtvance.gif" "right" "Flawless flank. You caught those bastards completely off guard!">>

<br><br>
<<if _arrivedLate>>
    <<chat "Commander Miller" "image/avatars/quartermaster_sgtvance.gif" "right" "Evelyn told me you got to Timberline late after sunrise. You operate like a seasoned scout.">>
<<else>>
    <<chat "Commander Miller" "image/avatars/quartermaster_sgtvance.gif" "right" "Evelyn told me you slipped into base early before the morning storm. Tactical precision at its finest.">>
<</if>>

<br><br>
<span style="color:var(--accent-gold); font-size: 1.2em; font-weight: bold;">[+60 XP] [+30 TRUST] [STEALTH BONUS]</span>
<<run window.gainXP(60)>>
<<run window.gainTrust(30)>>

<br><br>
/* COMPLETE RESCUE OBJECTIVE */
<<completeObjective "rescue_leader_711">>
<<purgeCompleted>>

<br><br>
<div class="choice-menu">
    <button style="border-left-color: var(--accent-green) !important;">
        <<link "🚗 Escort Commander Miller back to Timberline Sanctuary" "Act3_7Eleven_RescueSuccess">>
            <<addTime 15>>
        <</link>>
        <span class="btn-sub"><b style="color:var(--accent-green);">[MISSION COMPLETE]</b> Return to Timberline Sanctuary with the Commander and fuel.</span>
    </button>
</div>
